# OFLIT Child Time Limit — Per-User Scheduled Quotas
#
# Scheduled quotas are optional.
# Users without a section continue using the normal daily quota.
#
# Example:
#
# [azzahra]
# 09:00-12:00=3600
# 15:00-17:00=3600
#
# Rules:
# - Same-day slots only; overnight slots are not supported.
# - Slots for one user must not overlap.
# - Slot quota is measured as active-use seconds.
# - Unused quota does not carry over to another slot.
# - Total slot quota must not exceed the user's daily quota.
